      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## Save at-risk customers with an AI retention agent\n\n### How it works\n\nA customer who wants to cancel sends a request to the webhook. The workflow validates the request, an AI agent looks up the customer account in Airtable and decides the best save offer, the customer gets a personalized offer email, high-value accounts also alert the team on Telegram, every case is logged to Airtable, and a monthly churn report goes out by email and Telegram.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Create the Customers and Churn Cases tables in Airtable and add your customer records\n- Point your app, form, or payment provider to the webhook URL\n- Connect your Gmail and Telegram accounts\n- Trigger the workflow by POSTing a JSON body with customer email, plan, monthly revenue, and reason\n\n### Customization\n\n- Tune the save offers in the AI agent prompt\n- Change the monthly report schedule in the cron trigger"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
